        "en": "Most customers praise the counter staff for being approachable, friendly, and willing to share practical advice on pet care. Reviewers often mention individual assistants who helped carry heavy items or explained flea remedies. A couple of visitors reported feeling scrutinized or encountering dismissive service at the tills, though positive feedback remains predominant."
